WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.645 line:88% align:center
Sometimes it is quicker to edit a plan as text.

2
00:00:03.695 --> 00:00:06.147 line:88% align:center
For that, there is a live JSON editor.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.820 line:88% align:center
Open it, and it takes the left side of the screen.

4
00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:14.749 line:88% align:center
Every activity is one numbered line, with its start and its end.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.056 line:88% align:center
Change a date in the text,

6
00:00:17.106 --> 00:00:19.711 line:88% align:center
and the bar on the chart moves as you type.

7
00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:21.934 line:88% align:center
The two are always the same roadmap.

8
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.021 line:88% align:center
Typing mistakes happen.

9
00:00:24.071 --> 00:00:26.821 line:88% align:center
When the text is not valid, nothing is changed,

10
00:00:26.871 --> 00:00:29.682 line:88% align:center
and the message tells you which line to look at.

11
00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:32.188 line:88% align:center
Put it right, press Control S,

12
00:00:32.238 --> 00:00:34.474 line:88% align:center
and the text is laid out neatly again.

13
00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:37.003 line:88% align:center
Cards are listed here as well.

14
00:00:37.053 --> 00:00:40.581 line:88% align:center
Retype a title, and the card on the chart updates to match.

15
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.186 line:88% align:center
When you are ready to share,

16
00:00:43.236 --> 00:00:46.990 line:88% align:center
Export offers a roadmap file to keep, a standalone page,

17
00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.930 line:88% align:center
a view-only page, an image of what is on screen, or a PDF.

